-page","line":23},{"title":"Sending an email in Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/agent-workspace-for-hr-case-management/send-email-aws.md","line":32},{"title":"Create a reminder in Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/agent-workspace-for-hr-case-management/hr-agent-ws-reminder.md","line":33},{"title":"Creating a case from an HR case","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/agent-workspace-for-hr-case-management/hr-agent-ws-add-case.md","line":34},{"title":"Create a task for a case using Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/agent-workspace-for-hr-case-management/agent-ws-hr-case-mgmt-task.md","line":35},{"title":"Transfer a case in Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/agent-workspace-for-hr-case-management/hr-agent-ws-transfer-case.md","line":36},{"title":"Escalating a case in Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/agent-workspace-for-hr-case-management/hr-agent-ws-escalate-case.md","line":37},{"title":"Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"agent-ws-hr-case-mgmt-landing-page","line":42}],"metadata":{"title":"Using the More icon in Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","description":"You can use the More icon more icon from Agent Workspace for HR Case Management to perform many duties related to working on an HR case.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/em